4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e9Kvdjv2EosQ7kNvwGOogWV&_nc_oc=AdqLdnDfEVKYftN0hsoZcfX3-4fPjmkyKDmB_sHCa1ClY7sMDpG4a4QhilIV0hm-bKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5p0LI_eJlK9P7YG0fksyiWPP0fV_jgy5nkje16tiSu8g&oe=6A0B0E54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qTJpfSJx2tkQ7kNvwEB0J4D&_nc_oc=AdrpuTEbnZXExJc3fPfOJJt1pdpYbGa8wYecn1zKzw6KlacQ0prt7ySde3MukxI2Xac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5hNgG2vRuEWzM_r_iRYHO1lPqZIcEeOrSaJ4WHQHHy0A&oe=6A0B1332"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vONI_gMVlOkQ7kNvwGnUAbV&_nc_oc=Adp54S5QhJH6Xgnb-sBvUAxrIMmdHZzPOqtmkpr1bTMDai1aqj07sHzkVRzjsYvwkYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6nJl_nG9WwqglWTRMoNeuKqCucQn5ipncuD2sLJtrCZw&oe=6A0B20D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p